==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{Adv|Crystal}} receives a [[Pokédex]] and begins her Pokémon journey.
* Crystal encounters {{p|Suicune}}, and later the Suicune-obsessed Mysticalman [[Eusine]].
* Eusine snags the [[Clear Bell]]s from three {{tc|Team Rocket Grunt}}s.
* Crystal reaches the [[Burned Tower]].

